Overview of changes in lomiri-camera-app 4.1.1

  - Move resolution icon beside video quality.
  - Use current video resolution label instead of just HD.
  - Add video quality setting.
  - Add support for more resolutions and aspect ratio.
  - Simplify label of square aspect ratio to 1:1.
  - qml: Activate QZXing.SourceFilter_ImageInverted for
    imageSourceFilter.
  - Translation updates (thanks to all contributors on
    hosted.weblate.org).

Overview of changes in lomiri-camera-app 4.1.0

  - qml/Viewfinder: Fix content export preview corruption in !hasEXIF
    mode.
  - Update path for icon in about page.
  - Bump qtquick import in barcodereaderapp.qml to match version of all
    other imports.
  - Add fixes to barcodereader app and drop obsolete imports.
  - SlideshowView: fixup warnings.
  - Fixup codestyle.
  - Fixup warnings in MediaInfoPopover.
  - Fixup warnings in SlideshowView.
  - Fixup warning when settingsProperty is undefined.
  - Fixup warning on unknown image resolution.
  - Fixup warning when EXIF data is undefined.
  - Restructure source tree, move qml files into qml sub-directory.
  - Fix spelling of background color in AdvancedOptions.qml.
  - Show version number in about page, taken from CMake configuration.
  - Save orientation when erasing metadata.
  - Add left margin between icon and label in options selector.
  - Fix incorrect image quality on app startup.
  - Fix incorrect video resolution on app startup.
  - Translation updates (thanks to all contributors on
    hosted.weblate.org).

Overview of changes in lomiri-camera-app 4.0.8

  - Add option to erase EXIF metadata.
  - Redesigned video play icon.
  - Bump clickable minimum version.
  - CMakeLists.txt: Install content-hub peers configuration also when
    built as non-click package.
  - Translation updates (thanks to all contributors on
    hosted.weblate.org).

Overview of changes in lomiri-camera-app 4.0.7

  - Vectorise barcode icons.
  - {camera,barcode-reader}-app.qml: Fix title translation.
  - Various build system adaptations for shipping lomiri-camera-app
    in other GNU/Linux distributions such as Debian and NixOS.
  - Translation updates (thanks to all contributors on
    hosted.weblate.org).

Overview of changes in lomiri-camera-app 4.0.6

 - Fix position logic of OptionsOverlay.
 - Rotate relevant controls/UI even with locked screen orientation.
 - Reset photo grid view at index 0 in photo roll when back button is
   pressed.
 - Support Exiv2 0.28+.
 - Allow translation of the Barcode reader desktop file.
 - Translation updates.

